cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pen2STEP or Pen2STEP-Bench, please cite the following."
title: "Pen2STEP: A Deterministic Inference-Time Shell for Converting Photographed Hand-Drawn Multi-View Sketches into CadQuery Programs and STEP Solids without Additional Training"
abstract: >-
  Pen2STEP converts a photograph of a hand-drawn multi-view engineering sheet into a
  CadQuery program and a STEP solid by wrapping a publicly released image-to-CadQuery
  vision-language model (StoryGold/bella-v1.0-13b, a third-party LLaVA-NeXT fine-tune),
  used without additional training, in a deterministic inference-time shell. The repository also contains Pen2STEP-Bench, a dimension-annotated benchmark
  with 19 hand-drawn sheets and verified ground-truth solids.
type: software
